  "data": {
    "body": "Let $A$ be an $n \\times n$ matrix. Which of the following statements is/are NOT equivalent to that $A$ is invertible?\n\n\n(i) Columns of $A$ are linearly independent.\n\n(ii) $A$ is diagonalizable.\n\n(iii) Columns of $A$ is an orthonormal set.\n\n(iv) The dimension of the null space of $A$ is $0$.\n\n(v) The linear system $A X=b$ always has solution for any $b \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n}$.",
    "solution": [
      2
    ],
